      "end_block": "B052",
      "hook": "A haughty matriarch blocks Juliana in the aisle and coldly says, \"You should turn around, Juliana.\"",
      "cliffhanger": "Clarissa cruelly reveals, \"Long enough to know he was never going to marry you,\" leaving Juliana shattered and the full betrayal exposed.",
      "why": "Opens on a shocking dismissal, escalates through the sister's gloating reveal, and cuts before Juliana can respond.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know the matriarch is Juliana's mother figure or that Clarissa is her sister, but the cruelty is instantly clear."
    },
    {
      "title": "Worth Nothing to Him",
      "start_block": "B032",
      "end_block": "B089",
      "hook": "Juliana cries out in outrage, \"You knew this before I walked through those doors!\"",
      "cliffhanger": "Gerald declares Clarissa \"the true jewel of the county\" while Juliana's hand clenches in fury, cutting before she reacts.",
      "why": "Starts mid-accusation with raw emotion, builds through Gerald's cold rejection, and ends on his cruel comparison with no resolution.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know Gerald was her fiancé, but his callous dismissal and her devastation make the stakes clear."
    },
    {
      "title": "The Daughter They Tolerate",
      "start_block": "B073",
      "end_block": "B095",
      "hook": "Juliana demands, \"And I am what?\" and Clarissa viciously answers, \"You are the daughter people tolerate because they have to.\"",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana's tearful face hardens into fury as a solemn string drone swells and the screen cuts to black.",
      "why": "Starts on a venomous insult, builds through Gerald's final rejection, and ends on Juliana's transformation with no follow-up.",
      "context_gap": "A stranger may not know the family dynamics, but the cruelty of being 'tolerated' versus 'chosen' is universally understood."
    }
  ],
